# Supabase migrations directory.
#
# Migrations are applied in ascending version order and recorded in
# supabase_migrations.schema_migrations (R1.23). Each migration runs in a single
# transaction so a mid-migration failure rolls back entirely and registers no
# version (R1.20). Write DDL idempotently (IF NOT EXISTS / CREATE OR REPLACE) so
# applying the set twice equals applying it once (P9).
#
# The baseline schema, RLS policies, triggers, and RPC functions arrive in the
# Tenancy & RLS phase (README Phase 9), not in this scaffold.
